  "details": "Different frames for photographs you could buy from a store or unlock \n\nthe photograph system is nice, but I feel it could be visually improved or least you want something a bit better from the stock version.\n\nThe one I'd like to have is a 1800 picture frames with the picture a bit faded to match the theme.\n\nI'm sure plenty of players would love a family portrait size frame which is a tad bigger than stock version to fit \"everyone\"\n\nImagine having a Neon or cyberpunk animated frame for your photos or classic wooden ones or someone you like you can apply a heart frame around it which would be a great seller for Valentine's Day.\n\nOr maybe even a frame for statics and graphs if your someone enjoys showing off data.\n\nOr the forbidden idea of have a frameless photograph which I'm sure people would pay for.\n\nI know it's not an important feature, but I feel it would bring a bit more life to the older photograph system.",
